OpenKey cho Linux
=================

Phan engine (src/engine/) va thuat toan go tieng Viet lay nguyen tu OpenKey:
    https://github.com/tuyenvm/OpenKey
    Tac gia: Tuyen Mai (va cac cong tac vien)
    Giay phep: GNU General Public License v3.0 (xem LICENSE)

Lop giao tiep Wayland (src/main.cpp) va lop trung gian
(src/openkey_core.*) cung phat hanh duoi GPL-3.0 de tuong thich.

Day la ban chinh sua/phat trien them, khong phai ban phat hanh chinh thuc
cua OpenKey.
